  "prefLabel": "Bar 601.06 Tanning facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 601.06 “Tanning facility” means “tanning facility” as defined in RSA 313-A:1, XV, namely, “any location, place, area, structure or business which provides access to a tanning device for a fee, membership dues or any other compensation.”\n\nSource. #8444, eff 10-06-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #10808, eff 4-2-15, EXPIRED: 4-1-25\n\nNew. #14271, INTERIM, eff 6-16-25, EXPIRES: 12-14-25; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
